cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
- family-names: "Hickman"
  given-names: "Oscar"
title: "galform_analysis: A modular Python framework for analysing GALFORM simulation outputs"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-09
url: "https://github.com/OscarHickman/galform_analysis"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OscarHickman/galform_analysis"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - galform
  - galaxy formation
  - semi-analytic model
  - cosmology
abstract: >-
  A modular Python framework for reading and analysing GALFORM HDF5
  simulation outputs. It aggregates data across simulation subvolumes and
  computes stellar and halo mass functions, halo occupation distributions,
  two-point correlation functions with subvolume-weighted corrections, galaxy
  bias and redshift-space distortion multipoles.
